{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We take a classic roguelike deckbuilder (like Slay the Spire), with stand-up pictures hitting each other, and mix in a tactical, procedurally generated map, and you can also use obstacles!<br>We get a stormy mix that creates tens of thousands of combat variations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Usable obstacles!</strong> - Break bridges, throw stones, snack on berries right during the battle - this list can go on for a very long time!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.poster.avif?t=1753544120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.webm?t=1753544120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.mp4?t=1753544120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural Generation:</strong> It is generated with a height difference, obstacles in different places, enemies too, many variations of battles, ambushes, escorts, escape, all this generates such an unusual experience that you can play ENDLESSLY!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.poster.avif?t=1753544120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.webm?t=1753544120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.mp4?t=1753544120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore Amazing Worlds:</strong> Embark on an exciting adventure across four unique worlds! Discover rare cards, valuable artifacts, unexpected allies, and take on quests ranging from simple tasks to challenging trials. Each journey offers new discoveries and unforgettable experiences!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3442270?t=1753544120","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753544120","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/49ef9bea3d10b3490950b6607b7028153a154327/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753544120","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/49ef9bea3d10b3490950b6607b7028153a154327/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753544120","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We take a classic roguelike deckbuilder (like Slay the Spire), with stand-up pictures hitting each other, and mix in a tactical, procedurally generated map, and you can also use obstacles!<br>We get a stormy mix that creates tens of thousands of combat variations!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Usable obstacles!</strong> - Break bridges, throw stones, snack on berries right during the battle - this list can go on for a very long time!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.poster.avif?t=1753544120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.webm?t=1753544120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/85f341953716436a4b66a430e80db77c.mp4?t=1753544120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural Generation:</strong> It is generated with a height difference, obstacles in different places, enemies too, many variations of battles, ambushes, escorts, escape, all this generates such an unusual experience that you can play ENDLESSLY!<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.poster.avif?t=1753544120\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.webm?t=1753544120\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/extras/93796b699c003ca0c6359c27962814af.mp4?t=1753544120\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore Amazing Worlds:</strong> Embark on an exciting adventure across four unique worlds! Discover rare cards, valuable artifacts, unexpected allies, and take on quests ranging from simple tasks to challenging trials. Each journey offers new discoveries and unforgettable experiences!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Karno Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3442270/7602f5c81a4e4775af6bc8b6707ab1345e13651b/header.jpg?t=1753544120","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257171284,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.stea